{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first demo of <i>Deathly Reprieve</i>, a unique <strong>first-person shooter</strong> with <strong>real-time tactics</strong>. It includes a single level and two enemy encounters. You will be able to get a taste of the story, and learn to navigate the game's complex mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player PVE (Player Versus Environment)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gun Shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Riddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friendly Fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetic Reward</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spoken Languages</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Subtitles</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong> <br> <br>You find yourself on top of a hill with a simple mission. Infiltrate the mad scientist's base - steal one of his prized possessions. <br> <br>He and his endless army of robots will try to stop you, but you came prepared. <br> <br>Your soldiers, one hacker and one demolitionist, each with unique abilities, are willing to put their lives on the line. Who are you to deny such dedication? <br> <br>Use all the tools in your arsenal. Be observant, solve riddles, aim true. <br>Nothing a seasoned mercenary like you can't handle... <br> <br><i>An <strong>exclusive</strong> cosmetic <u><strong>reward</strong></u> awaits those that emerge victorious, available through all future iterations of Deathly Reprieve. Don't miss out!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/Strategize.png?t=1742317596\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/StrategizeGIFOpt.gif?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your attack carefully, all in slow-mo fashion. Use cover, outflank enemies, and manage resources to survive relentless encounters. The battlefield is unforgiving, and only the sharpest minds will prevail.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/Adapt.png?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/AdaptGIFOpt.gif?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything will go your way. Use your deductive skills to find solutions. Observe your surroundings.\u00a0The world is brutal, and survival demands more than just quick reflexes\u2014it requires the ability to think ahead and change your strategy on the fly.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/Overcome.png?t=1742317596\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/OvercomeGIFOpt.gif?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See? it wasn't <strong>THAT</strong> difficult...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Curious Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538410/857926b7422ad5f8d7daf54e02f124895f7deb31.jpg"},{"name":"Box Buster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538410/9627813858f9a3d2ab38b1406fb7a2873869b3e9.jpg"},{"name":"O.C.D.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538410/79a3e8a72a9099be077d0e5fd0965ee9dbf7b66c.jpg"},{"name":"Potential Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538410/a98f251c45bf51bd84b95b40d55a23b7e5dbee51.jpg"},{"name":"Shooting Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538410/ccd2a9029c2ceb0c1753a391ba5f70ec8a4f9094.jpg"},{"name":"Demo completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538410/19ae613827f8432dfb0cae4e78d38738b2a6a4a5.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538410?t=1742317596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/42ea664157c79d84533be28a030f303effc9dfba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742317596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/88185f02bbf4f8d5051e54e3a552dffccd943fc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742317596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/88185f02bbf4f8d5051e54e3a552dffccd943fc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742317596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first demo of <i>Deathly Reprieve</i>, a unique <strong>first-person shooter</strong> with <strong>real-time tactics</strong>. It includes a single level and two enemy encounters. You will be able to get a taste of the story, and learn to navigate the game's complex mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player PVE (Player Versus Environment)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragr