se cover, outflank enemies, and manage resources to survive relentless encounters. The battlefield is unforgiving, and only the sharpest minds will prevail.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/Adapt.png?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/AdaptGIFOpt.gif?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything will go your way. Use your deductive skills to find solutions. Observe your surroundings.\u00a0The world is brutal, and survival demands more than just quick reflexes\u2014it requires the ability to think ahead and change your strategy on the fly.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/Overcome.png?t=1742317596\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/extras/OvercomeGIFOpt.gif?t=1742317596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See? it wasn't <strong>THAT</strong> difficult...</p>","developers":["Satyr Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2760620","name":"Deathly Reprieve"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538410/9ec00ae9f3f6376b916ad797a0f3855526dd93e2/header.jpg?t=1742317596","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Satyr Interactive. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100929,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100929/movie480.mp4?